# Cursor Cloud environment

## Git identity

- Use **`cyre <diazMelgarejo@gmail.com>`** for commits unless user specifies another approved identity.
- Do **not** add forbidden or random Gmail `Co-authored-by` trailers.
- `CURSOR_AGENT=1` is set by the platform; **`CURSOR_AGENT=0` is not supported** and does not disable hooks.

## Co-author injection (cloud)

Cursor redirects `core.hookspath` to `~/.cursor/agent-hooks/<base64-workspace>/` and may run `commit-msg.cursor.co-author`. Mitigations (run every session):

```bash
bash scripts/cursor/install-user-git-environment.sh   # ~/.cursor/openclaw + sessionStart hook
bash scripts/git/apply-attribution-guard-all-repos.sh # orama + PT + AlphaClaw
```

Hook-free commit when needed:

```bash
bash scripts/git/commit-clean.sh -m "type(scope): summary"
```

## AlphaClaw fork (three repos)

| Repo branch | Purpose |
|-------------|---------|
| `main` | Upstream mirror only |
| `feature/MacOS-post-install` | Integration — must contain `origin/main` |
| `cursor/sync-attribution-guards-6421` | Contrib — PR **into integration**, not `main` |

Before AlphaClaw commits:

```bash
bash scripts/git/alphaclaw-align-all.sh
```

Verify:

```bash
bash scripts/cursor/verify-git-guards.sh   # orama
# AlphaClaw: merge-base with origin/main must be origin/main tip
```

## Push when user grants access

```bash
bash scripts/cursor/push-openclaw-stack.sh
```

See `docs/wiki/13-alphaclaw-fork-contrib-branches.md`.
